Defaults: 1000 blocks, 128 frames, 48000 Hz, 73 keys, 32 warmup blocks, held, 64.
All workloads retrigger the selected keys at block zero and about every 0.5 s.
held keeps note ownership; gain adds one gain point per sample. pedal releases
the struck keys immediately and flips sustain at every sample while they ring.
Only the actual process() call is timed, including host input access, validation,
ownership, automation, output clearing, rendering and state publication.
Prints JSON with raw timings and output checks. No device/realtime guarantee.
